openccu-loom — embedded CCU metadata archives
=============================================

The files in this directory ship alongside the openccu-loom binary so
the daemon produces useful device labels out of the box. They are
sourced from the openccu-data project:

    https://github.com/SukramJ/openccu-data

openccu-data is the single source of truth for HomeMatic CCU metadata
extracts consumed by the aiohomematic ecosystem (aiohomematic,
aiohomematic-config, openccu-loom).

File manifest
-------------

    translation_extract.json.gz   — raw CCU stringtable extract
    easymode_extract.json.gz      — TCL easymode extract
    profiles/<RECEIVER>.json.gz   — receiver link-profile per type
    profiles/_receiver_type_aliases.json — alias table (MIT)
    translation_custom/*.json     — curated translation overrides (MIT)

